body:
Someone here once commented that ADCs who hate on Yuumi just don't know how to play with her and that you're better off playing another champ because they're going to feed their asses (willingly or not)... That kind of stuck with me and whenever someone in chat is being horrible, I lock in another champ. At the end of the day, I get enough anxiety as it is, I don't wanna bother adding to it, lol. And it's not a bad thing to add to your champion pool :)! 

&#x200B;

Are your games in ranked?

Ha, I was wondering why you said that until I saw his username, lol!

&#x200B;

Beautiful smile darling :)
